WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
A sunlit campus road runs between green trees and neatly trimmed hedges.

00:03.000 --> 00:04.267
An overhead view follows a curved road around a landscaped green with palms.

00:04.267 --> 00:05.400
A quiet road winds beneath a canopy of leafy trees.

00:05.400 --> 00:08.267
Aerial views show campus buildings surrounded by dense greenery.
